- Inside the brackets is where you put the attributes you want to modify. You can follow this example, but you should definitely check CSS documentation sites, such as W3Schools.com.

This code will change the style of your HTML <p> tags with the following properties: color (text color) and background-color (the color of the background of the <p> HTML tag).
